# Run from the project root: npm run docs:record
Output docs/terminal-demo.gif
Output docs/terminal-demo.mp4
Require node
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 1440
Set Height 1100
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Github"
Set Framerate 15
Set TypingSpeed 0
Hide
Type "node scripts/terminal-demo.mjs"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 30s
